 ca0d56c0df8e7dfcd84ca0746cf1ba63ece7163062cceb92033db687b9a02dfc9483cffe24745e9f301286a243e7e832a73add565f249d4b193cdde588d8d969  0045-arm64-dts-qcom-sm8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep-Add-rem.patch
+9c1922b5506c7b69be2643d5c8c8b41176c2d10dda1e7f09136d906dbcbd4aa3dc43a0634c48396cf1fdd362c97cfa144ee2082df70fe9856b4fffa854c12de0  0046-soc-qcom-oneplus-sensor-devinfo-Let-the-device-tree-.patch
